    "detailed_description": "The worst nightmare is the first person horror puzzle game. A game about reliving a nightmare.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game begins with the player's car accident, after which he wakes up at the scene of the accident.<br />\r\nafter that he sees the entrance to the cave he enters to take shelter, but after entering the entrance to the cave he collapses. Then you look for a way out of that cave, wandering through the cave you come across a broken wall leading to the entrance to the dungeon. Looking for a way out of the dungeon, you come across a monster that follows you all the way out of the dungeon and the castle. In front of the castle gates you come across a car that you escaping into the city and come to the hospital, and the sequel will find out by playing my game.",
